paramType.getActualTypeArguments(), 0); 
Class<?> actualWrapperClass = InjectionUtils.getActualType(actualWrapperParamType); 

This actual class type check can be done inside getJAXBContext. This will do automatic deep check and setting into JAXB context only for custom payload types. 

Or else expose the jaxb context map to be accessible when extend AbstractJAXBprovider or JAXBElementProvider.

